    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: For crop varieties grouped by documented selection target, compare among-race standardized divergence in selected organs with divergence in unselected organs. Predominantly greater divergence in the selected part supports the rule; comparable divergence elsewhere refutes it.";
